     1→//! Power Duration Curve (PDC) calculation and management.
     2→//!
     3→//! The PDC represents the maximum average power a rider can sustain for any given duration.
     4→//! This module provides:
     5→//! - MMP (Mean Maximal Power) extraction from ride data
     6→//! - PDC storage and update logic
     7→//! - Interpolation for arbitrary durations
